nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI宣布将于9月12日发布2.1万亿参数Grok 4.7模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">World Labs发布首个多模态世界模型Atlas，支持像素级镜头控制与3D重建</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布ChatGPT for Healthcare正式集成Epic电子健康记录系统</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌计划最快周三发布Gemini 3.8 Flash模型，代号Skimaki强化编程能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌计划最快于当地时间周三推出全新模型Gemini 3.8 Flash，内部代号“Skimaki”。该模型定位为Flash系列，主打轻量化、高运行速度与低成本。在谷歌内部Jetski编程工具对比测试中，Gemini 3.8 Flash的工程师偏好度已超过Anthropic的Opus模型，显著缩小了谷歌在编程能力上与OpenAI及Anthropic旗舰模型的差距。此次发布正值DeepMind团队管理层调整，由Koray Kavukcuoglu接手运营并要求加快执行速度。尽管定位更高的Pro系列新模型发布延期，但谷歌已将研发重心转向强化学习与后训练环节，并招募前OpenAI后训练负责人Barret Zoph出任研究副总裁负责技术攻坚。Gemini 3.8 Flash的上线旨在通过性能提升，在激烈的模型竞赛中重塑谷歌</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯WorkBuddy开放平台正式上线，全面开放Agent基座能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce64992f52c57303cbeaba28bce2f3ce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月2日，腾讯WorkBuddy开放平台（open.WorkBuddy.cn）正式上线，标志着其底层Agent基座能力全面向生态开放。该平台旨在打造面向Agent时代的操作系统，通过连接多元能力与场景，赋能智能硬件与行业应用。首批已引入超百家生态伙伴，其中9款联名智能硬件首发亮相，涵盖Plaud、Rokid、影石、科大讯飞、安克、猛玛及京东京造等品牌。同时，30余个行业应用同步接入，覆盖金融、法律、医疗、教育及公益等20多个领域。腾讯云副总裁、腾讯CodeBuddy &amp; WorkBuddy负责人刘毅强调，WorkBuddy的核心定位是承载各类工具的平台，而非单一工具。此次开放将加速Agent技术在垂直行业的落地，通过标准化接口与生态协同，推动生产力工具向智能化、场景化深度演进，为开发者与硬件厂商提供更广阔的集成</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI宣布将于9月12日发布2.1万亿参数Grok 4.7模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">埃隆·马斯克正式预告，xAI将于2026年9月12日推出全新Grok 4.7模型。该模型参数规模达到2.1万亿（2.1T），较前代Grok 4.6的1.5万亿参数增长约40%。马斯克表示，尽管Grok 4.7在服务响应速度上可能略有下降，但其在综合性能表现及Token效率上均有显著提升。此前数据显示，Grok 4.6性能已超越GPT-5.6 Sol，仅次于Opus 5和Fable 5。马斯克对此充满信心，认为Grok 4.7上线后将实现对现有主流AI竞品的全面反超，进一步巩固xAI在LLM领域的竞争优势。此次迭代标志着xAI在追求超大规模参数与高性能模型路径上的持续加速，对行业内大模型参数规模竞争格局产生直接影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">World Labs发布首个多模态世界模型Atlas，支持像素级镜头控制与3D重建</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d091820a9a03ead9beb9374b00c750ce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">李飞飞创办的World Labs正式发布全球首个多模态世界模型Atlas，该模型具备像素级精确的相机控制能力，可实现电影级“子弹时间”效果。Atlas支持从单张或多张图像输入，生成长达1分钟的1440p高清视频，并能进行高精度的3D场景重建与显式三维输出。在技术实现上，Atlas通过空间上下文定位输入视图，自主补全场景细节，并支持时空模拟、文本生成图像及360度全景渲染。该模型不仅能增强视频的戏剧性视觉效果，还可为机器人的真实到模拟（Sim-to-Real）工作流程提供支持。目前，World Labs已向部分合作伙伴开放抢先体验，并计划在未来几周内逐步扩大早期访问范围。Atlas在重建效果与空间控制力上表现突出，为世界生成与模拟任务提供了全新的技术路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布ChatGPT for Healthcare正式集成Epic电子健康记录系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2b7f235990219b27eb3f051d440d0de.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日宣布，ChatGPT for Healthcare已正式支持与Epic电子健康记录（EHR）系统集成，旨在打破医疗数据孤岛。医务人员可通过该集成直接调取患者病历、实验室结果及用药信息，并利用AI自动总结病情变化、识别药物调整及梳理随访事项。OpenAI提供两种部署方式：将患者信息导入分析或将AI助手直接嵌入EHR工作流。此外，OpenAI同步推出Healthcare Public Data插件，连接PubMed、ClinicalTrials.gov等9个权威数据源，支持高效检索临床试验及医保政策等信息。在安全性方面，经27种临床场景测试，4363项评分中99.1%被评定为安全，且超93%的回答准确性良好。目前，Epic集成功能仅面向机构级医疗组织开放，符合条件的ChatGPT for Clini</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
